></span><strong></strong></strong></p></section></section></section><p><strong><span><span>复 审</span></span></strong><span><strong><span><span>丨鲍   旭</span></span></strong></span></p><p><strong><span><span>终 审</span></span></strong><span><strong><span><span>丨冯   婵</span></span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"40e7795155605d572d3fc9dec6ea79960dbebcdb91d5d34eda599bcfa8963967","textLength":3006,"sourceSha256":"7879d8091b8bf50d62dec7670a056fa83fefdb13bef32bf1dd42682dcf8354f7","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-ebf69406825a12516536","title":"2026年武汉体育学院新闻传播学院2027年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读硕士研究生预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:16.612895+00:00"}
